    {
      "GroupDto": {
        "GroupName": "OROUT",
        "Description": "NAND reading (inputs A and B, BIAS constantly on, threshold 0.125) of the shipped \u0027Logic Gate NOT-NAND\u0027 gate. Role in the full adder: carry-out of the full adder, Y = NAND(NOT(C1), NOT(C2)) = C1 OR C2 = majority(A, B, Cin) \u2014 the carry of the chained half adders. The whole full adder composes at the logic layer, not optically: every gate\u0027s truth table is extracted once in isolation, so each stage restores clean 0/1 levels by construction \u2014 there is deliberately no multi-stage passive optical cascade here. The fan-out of A, B and Cin onto several gates happens at the logic layer (each gate input is driven by the same network bit); shared stages are duplicated as extra gate instances because the canvas wires one waveguide per pin (like NAND1A/NAND1B in \u0027Logic Gate Half Adder\u0027).",
        "Identifier": "group_0639f4ef73284f7c9a66780ff1d21874",
        "IdGuid": "0dcfefcb-82cd-4457-b507-8e6a7be2c0c7",
        "ChildComponentGuids": [
          "3b3da23e-15ee-4857-ba8f-a6c0d7631cc8",
          "989e9d8f-8891-48ec-9781-af6ca570e3f7",
          "483ed51b-5773-4468-9f95-74236d91edfd",
          "8030c42a-b1fb-4810-ab5e-444f90e617fb",
          "0098e1a5-88f1-4523-ae68-32d55d63807d",
          "dea55f02-bbc1-46c1-9939-37e86bc55fbc"
        ],
        "GridX": 0,
        "GridY": 0,
        "PhysicalX": 12400,
        "PhysicalY": 2100,
